{1}{I know who you are.  [The man before you is thin, wiry, with grey, wolfish eyes.  He fingers a dagger on his belt.]}{I know who you are.  [The man before you is thin, wiry, with grey, wolfish eyes.  He fingers a dagger on his belt.]}{}{}{}{gf2600 1}
