{23}{Ha ha ha ha!   A valiant attempt my friend!  I'd have done the same thing myself, had I been in your position.  [His face goes still.]  And now, I'd know that my ruse hadn't worked.  Did you really think the Hand wouldn't recognize its prey?  We've been looking for you for a long time, stranger...}{Ha ha ha ha!   A valiant attempt my friend!  I'd have done the same thing myself, had I been in your position.  [His face goes still.]  And now, I'd know that my ruse hadn't worked.  Did you really think the Hand wouldn't recognize its prey?  We've been looking for you for a long time, stranger...}{}{}{}{}
