{32}{[He bows, slightly.]  I am Gideon Laier, First Blade of the Molochean Hand.  I have sought you for a long time.  And here you are, having walked into my very arms.  Interesting, indeed...}{[He bows, slightly.]  I am Gideon Laier, First Blade of the Molochean Hand.  I have sought you for a long time.  And here you are, having walked into my very arms.  Interesting, indeed...}{}{}{}{}
