{88}{[He is silent for a long time.]  So, you do know of our history.  You may very well be the only living person, outside of the Hand, who knows these things.  That we once served such evil ends is a shame to us...}{[He is silent for a long time.]  So, you do know of our history.  You may very well be the only living person, outside of the Hand, who knows these things.  That we once served such evil ends is a shame to us...}{}{}{}{}
{89}{Why was the Hand so shamed?}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{91}{Do you have any idea what sort of a monster that Kerghan the Terrible was?  He discovered all of the dark necromantic arts.  He used to experiment on living souls, killing them, and then raising them from the dead.  The Derian-Ka were his evil prodigy, and we served them unquestioningly for 500 years.  We had never been told of what Kerghan had done...}{Do you have any idea what sort of a monster that Kerghan the Terrible was?  He discovered all of the dark necromantic arts.  He used to experiment on living souls, killing them, and then raising them from the dead.  The Derian-Ka were his evil prodigy, and we served them unquestioningly for 500 years.  We had never been told of what Kerghan had done...}{}{}{}{}
{92}{And then your leader, Trellian, found something...}{}{5}{}{94}{}
{94}{Yes...it is said that he found the writings of Kerghan, which described in detail the experiments he used to perform on his victims.  It made Trellian sick with revulsion and despair.  He vowed to destroy the Derian-Ka, no matter what the cost...}{Yes...it is said that he found the writings of Kerghan, which described in detail the experiments he used to perform on his victims.  It made Trellian sick with revulsion and despair.  He vowed to destroy the Derian-Ka, no matter what the cost...}{}{}{}{}
